{"id":"1353291691268767744","identityId":"1239724074505539584","name":"漂泊者-男-气动","displayName":"漂泊者 · 男","romanizedName":"ROVER","description":"身世不明的共鸣者，拥有吸收一切声音的力量。 为了寻回记忆而踏上旅途。","resonanceName":"声之容器","gender":"男","origin":"未知","identity":"未知","affiliation":"未知","specialty":"","weapon":"迅刀","element":"气动","releaseVersion":"V2.2","cv":{"中文":"马洋","日文":"増田俊树","英文":"Chase Brown","韩文":"Kim Sin Woo"},"avatar":{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/newHead/aki/man.png","width":500,"height":500,"fallbackUrl":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/c3e3365e6e6c4d09911fbcc7d90307f120251118.png"},"hero":{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/18294b3eedc0480e82cf0ec58d707ae120250323.png","label":"编队立绘","kind":"team","orientation":"desktop","width":1129,"height":1654},"poster":null,"artworks":[{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/b17220a6c6904ebb80bb868f8639857220250323.png","label":"立绘","kind":"portrait","orientation":"desktop","width":719,"height":713},{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/18294b3eedc0480e82cf0ec58d707ae120250323.png","label":"编队立绘","kind":"team","orientation":"desktop","width":1129,"height":1654},{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/343cbceb6855406aa128f96ab3e2e24220250323.png","label":"编队立绘 · 移动版","kind":"team","orientation":"mobile","width":1129,"height":1654}],"archives":[],"treasures":[],"stories":[],"outfits":[],"voices":[{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-9-0-1324173188937191424","title":"闲趣1","text":"（语气词）","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749090135622316.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-9-0-1324173189753888768","title":"闲趣2","text":"它是我与这世界的连结，见证我所经历的一切。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749090314703714.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-9-0-1324173190052077568","title":"闲趣3","text":"（语气词）","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749090377182837.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-9-0-1324173090802262016","title":"入队1","text":"路途还很遥远，继续前进吧。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749066739819890.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-9-0-1324173090611159040","title":"入队2","text":"新的发现吗？","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749066713146671.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-9-0-1324173091213303808","title":"入队3","text":"我想留在大家身边……从过去，一同迈向明天。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749066787368942.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-9-0-1324173157349888000","title":"突破1","text":"世界……似乎变得更加清晰。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749082607429354.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-9-0-1324173159387521024","title":"突破2","text":"这股力量虽有些不可思议，却让我感到十分的安心。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749083088264535.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-9-0-1324173159663951872","title":"突破3","text":"我还需要更多的时间去了解、熟悉这陌生的世界。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749083151751347.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-9-0-1324173162332721152","title":"突破4","text":"又是新的旅途吗？新的声音，新的故事，还有……碎片般的记忆。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749083765602327.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-9-0-1324173162096648192","title":"突破5","text":"陆止于此，海始于斯，我们的旅途还远未结束。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749083720777613.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362897866043858944","title":"普攻1","text":"狂风，化为利刃。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981772598442727.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362897866727530496","title":"普攻2","text":"呼啸吧。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981772816377962.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362897868212314112","title":"普攻3","text":"荡涤诸恶。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981773163278234.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362897864548757504","title":"共鸣技能1","text":"风起。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981772291364246.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362897865555390464","title":"共鸣技能2","text":"剑扬狂澜。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981772542760853.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362897865131765760","title":"共鸣技能3","text":"诸邪尽斩。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981772442211381.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362897865934807040","title":"共鸣技能4","text":"不义奸邪……","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981772620193448.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362897866215825408","title":"共鸣技能5","text":"皆当审判！","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981772624537143.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362897865188220928","title":"共鸣解放1","text":"呼风，横断无垠！","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981772349273694.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362897869028274176","title":"共鸣解放2","text":"唤潮，裁决已至！","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981773360750055.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362897868663369728","title":"共鸣解放3","text":"我，即是风暴！","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981773276993126.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362899387718643712","title":"变奏技能","text":"风动浪随。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744982135324496827.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362897971448983552","title":"受击1","text":"（语气词）","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981797784629960.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362897971018899456","title":"受击2","text":"唔……找准时机。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981797668293824.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362897971056648192","title":"受击3","text":"再来一次。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981797664624339.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362898008115589120","title":"重伤1","text":"呼……","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981806522469414.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362898010703474688","title":"重伤2","text":"保持冷静。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981807133162595.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362898012068552704","title":"重伤3","text":"最后的机会……","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981807449660644.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362898061959798784","title":"力竭1","text":"还不能……结束","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981819353192566.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353291691268767744-voice-10-0-1362898064866451456","title":"力竭2","text":